#: scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecfaa23651c1384135e9946631c807f929628799ca8ba642f7dbcd2ebe0abc0f
#. default-sha256: c7a3fb0b4f71208fc9eb7d163369c7e5cd0fc24f0b14f8167033676f6794123e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_080B2007_53A6_4FE7_BD90_F4AAD1AF51DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫His was a power that evoked images of witches or demons—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"the unclean and the impure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫——不慎碰触到后，⟪k:5⟫就会夺走他人的生命……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64cf9244a244569b67ae1378417a968091d6f3ad97c89a91d57e02c2052cde45
#. default-sha256: 557e4717e2144f41b1a6c7935af953cc5e21d3a891789ad4589d248ff0dc7fde
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FE12BF3C_FFEF_4F7E_920D_8D5597E9854C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A mere touch was all it took for him to strip man and beast alike of its life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这不就像是，⟪k:1⟫恶魔或者魔女……⟪k:2⟫诸如此类的不净之物吗？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6080b211f8af3dd7084e5718265e35514f248c8cb11881632682fe8ab9c3f83
#. default-sha256: da940577e8051037b92d264f2b3d3a794298b8362244df0953671c70fc63740f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_86AC2019_95A5_471D_A9E3_D12F70D216F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God has quite a cruel streak to bestow such a power upon such a beautiful young man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫明明是外表如此俊美的青年，⟪k:1⟫神明真的是非常残酷。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17d78219cd903b6aa75b00870ff333c26e435dbc7628aa523fdd5c1b1b91d6aa
#. default-sha256: 244fea706a13b5e0e5ad219b94a0b426b68e87b510186f12b71dc6a5e5bf2a8e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_597AFB6B_813A_4B73_89CA_D340BFCED63F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a strange power it was indeed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫虽说如此，⟪k:1⟫但这实在太过不可思议。⟪k:2⟫「仅仅接触他，就会危及生命」之类的……仿佛是童话故事"
"中的情节。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ca7b4f9006f852e444de33be6e7988b844ed05af7e6c002af2ebc467a05e4ab
#. default-sha256: 7019a7d7474e2bdd29affeb050b77764d39c48ec69849b83973a69cf750de608
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9098F8C1_3796_4C8A_B2F5_0370866CB13B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Like something confined to words upon the page, it seemed otherworldly—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫更像是完全脱离了现实，⟪k:1⟫只有书本上才存在的故事——如果真是「故事」就好了。⟪k:2⟫总之，⟪k:3⟫这"
"实在让人无法相信。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 796945653d8d6407ded1de21f4028251a54be069651c26e7187b54949fed7bb3
#. default-sha256: fa76570001cefbad3bc6ab2de148f135431733f85bd734f084ce0238f5bec05a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32A3BC75_E658_4EBF_9EC9_03A66D122768"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, as he had demonstrated to the White-Haired Girl,⟪k:1⟫his peculiar powers were "
"indeed real."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然而，⟪k:1⟫正是这种不可思议之事，⟪k:2⟫在他身上成为了现实。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39fc06f76a5a584231c3ad4f96f6bd03731ae2e77f93231c9a71fbbcc010bb75
#. default-sha256: c871d870ba5bd1641dd63cf5224362965df6190b047814683f8097de3671fa61
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_100746D0_4882_4A6C_9891_2AB1CB04E750"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, the world has its fair share of oddities—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这个世界上，⟪k:1⟫总是充满着不可思议之事。⟪k:2⟫只不过，这些不可思议的事——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85e40cb5ca0f4b5f85bd661ba78a31d2334674021bc4b4b4f95d9aad22c6fc13
#. default-sha256: 448f5be9f3c1abbeb34068c7e6ed1a21d6e0bb2784dfe636d9612b385d5adbb1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0BD2FA9E_A735_4A4A_B086_D5F56F5DCA58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫it just so happens that those curiosities tend to remain hidden away, known only to a few."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大都像他一样隐藏起来，⟪k:1⟫永远不会被世间所知晓吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9cd26176e8e9fb4cd6fe7d9a6a4942a0396bed0b6d9c422693ce65f6b3756b9
#. default-sha256: fdef610a0a4cc4fe54cf7070be50bf620c2114b9dab5f6b28785a9283b9df805
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A7C64CA8_D0DC_4929_B370_35086EB52112"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Although, you have laid eyes upon a number of unusual phenomena yourself, "
"Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫呵呵……⟪k:1⟫说起来，⟪k:2⟫老爷您，⟪k:3⟫已经体验过许多超乎现实的事了吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f1782423739ca50ed83c7b69de2a7da7ed145eb9a86abeffa6065bf490ffbd3
#. default-sha256: 216c24564b4bf0b1bef215fe3cb9408abedbbb48f4a642c01b76ef73930946bf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DDF71E19_07F1_4BEF_B6BA_100C84D6A6F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The doors to the past through which we have passed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This very mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫比如，和下仆一起，⟪k:1⟫穿越过的那些通向过去的「门」……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫或者说，和下仆一起所处的这座"
"馆……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17e77e149775395cfd9e23c39daaec746acdbcd9318b3fc06390b4715e2f5ad0
#. default-sha256: 728eaf2bf5466e417e272ddb254727a119882711143bbfccdea7e4cd379e4508
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8A0F831_78C5_4AC6_96C6_38E7C8EF891F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And, as a matter of fact, the two of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫况且——⟪k:1⟫就连下仆，和老爷您「存在」着的这件事本身……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1b2c63dfea1751082bb660c7f7af5bac2bc2b022bdec7bd9a526a241604f4ce
#. default-sha256: 6a7bd619af565e8315e82ff5e270a612701360cdb353cd84a1c473c5a1967a13
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_915E76E1_FB5E_422E_AA7F_BD2522DB5BE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as you just saw, the White-Haired Girl found herself enraptured with this man and his "
"accursed power."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫还是让我们回到正题吧。⟪k:1⟫于是，⟪k:2⟫白发少女似乎在不知不觉中，⟪k:3⟫被那位受到诅咒的青年夺走"
"了心。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 717f7a1deba0b7152420bad025a986c3782ab0e357f30ae057792869139c99ef
#. default-sha256: 276749d7022bf3675e83483ea4e34768b5fa4eb21f1dfac209749b7147d33119
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_446CC45D_0D41_45FF_8AC6_F9723AEDE98F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How do you think Michel acted in response to her proclamation?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫听到少女的「告白」的米歇尔，⟪k:1⟫您觉得他此刻是怎么想的呢？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ed19091f21c0681309410b84e4ff8eb06dfba32b1d73ae917634d10c69ca0cf
#. default-sha256: f6d45a220413e909a99670ae9b8ab7cb90f5b4e92f8ca293879ba4562318887a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_70B6DA8E_A300_4F18_93EA_9079A9144F3C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had spent so long refusing to interact with others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫unable⟪k:4⟫ to "
"interact with them. ⟪k:5⟫As such, he was unsure how to respond."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他迄今为止都始终拒绝着与人交流——⟪k:1⟫倒不如说，⟪k:2⟫是无法与他人交流。⟪k:3⟫故而，⟪k:4⟫他完全"
"不明白该如何是好。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 433b2bec9ac53b1a7d8b84c52be897c91013f1f088aece4b42a70bb3074df874
#. default-sha256: 80d7546815e0bd8387a9b897e3e83c423431471f4127941f5edb0ec2ee700bc7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8EF2143C_B757_414D_AB1D_74DA9556FC56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After standing there expressionless for a few moments, he muttered,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他面无表情地短暂呆在了原地，⟪k:1⟫只挤出一句话——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407a22b16daf6ce64152142c3936ca20b2ba95ff8b1ce0bb9f8893cd6a0a13c8
#. default-sha256: 877e11a63ef9e2d86ac03ccb1304b1e60e927a8b65fce59599b9b056b631a521
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CD55C3F8_A905_4230_AD11_110D456B5E9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll consider it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我考虑一下。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e9de77b0623ed6588f8b2acec32bb1122b44eee4f276f9b0380903dfc0f90a6
#. default-sha256: 98c78b3f955969afa2112a0af98aec4629fa9e1b26f60b106d74320926cdb8c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_736BAF79_427A_4E66_B723_722488B5F776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And with that, he returned to his chambers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫言毕，⟪k:1⟫径直返回了自己的房间。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10374420bad941fcdb6aa4e144aadb5d67fd11ba6797516fca2a931d4043bb11
#. default-sha256: be414e4d8db6f017d9d60a2c4d96140a21b152b5621b6aac0e494bdcdc402437
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_527E3E63_6525_4BB5_98A7_2D237A0BFD96"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he was not someone who wore his heart on his sleeve,⟪k:1⟫I personally do not believe "
"he was completely devoid of emotions."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下仆，⟪k:1⟫是这样理解的——⟪k:2⟫他只是，感情表现得非常淡漠，但绝不是没有感情。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10d9dc6a41ada03b30dd9ef1c562c05c12462e4fa860b8f72f3517da7ee6c79e
#. default-sha256: 9e5623064de03b07cd786ca20807aad33a6d0c4dc5010019c392d39e792ff252
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_32F6F341_FDAA_448E_9958_F339D58F7B6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had simply forgotten how to express them in his extended solitude."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫独自一人生活的时间，⟪k:1⟫实在太过……太过长久，⟪k:2⟫所以，连该露出什么表情，都已经不记得了吧？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9690d551714638b4e5df983a06e529fca62e4adf35b285218e6622a0ce82c5b
#. default-sha256: d9dc766ddf44a6f8b409dbfa8031edc1b057d70d355092af18e1be7e7b353b55
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790071D5_5A70_46AA_9375_6BD9F3292563"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I think he was, in that moment, in a state of complete panic."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以下仆认为——⟪k:1⟫那时他的反应，⟪k:2⟫已经表达出最大程度的动摇了。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40bc4334ebff04d36d0995bc63e69ffec4af730957e96bb58f91c359d63de1f1
#. default-sha256: edb044cc4826111facfcd1c7f63c9eee578d6dc38c2009213d32a5d708759d71
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC33860C_4C15_40F4_A6E3_1E3C08EB113C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had, after all, just assaulted him with a stream of incomprehensible declarations:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫毕竟，⟪k:1⟫少女所说出的，是他所无法理解的话语。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6ca8d1e9ced7b0a837c10ca05bbed9228761f86d0e29b59151e8a0bc058e375
#. default-sha256: e07bfd700fb52de7a6d4309e7b7a0a45c2c4737fc753bfc721caa8b008a906d6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E5D92A94_F292_4C2C_8D9D_8443D5D2B311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫that, knowing the truth, she still wished to remain in the mansion..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使得知了他的秘密，⟪k:1⟫仍然坚持要留在馆内。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e0d21903b76995feeb66013477bca40a9b1454e8404fafcd2a5fc091fc2526e
#. default-sha256: b2b9930a0e433b62d8ea7f072613100d2a8a8889681f354a58141cbad622ea24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_16200131_11A1_4A98_9983_68F65BACF567"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and that, knowing the truth, she loved him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫甚至于，⟪k:1⟫在得知了他的秘密后，⟪k:2⟫还说出「我喜欢你」这样的话。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95a5dbbaece65527d5fdae32fa9bdee214a144305c8bed390e57abd219eee9d8
#. default-sha256: 017d084d6c3566b6eb692fa3015fb002f830129c9e022f7e101b0e46ed0d0614
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8756CEDF_43A7_4F0B_998C_407CA088D4F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The love she had declared for Michel was not a fleeting puppy love;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫there was "
"genuine tenderness and warmth to her words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她唇齿间所吐露的，⟪k:1⟫「喜欢」这个词语，⟪k:2⟫也并非轻飘飘的话语。⟪k:3⟫而是更加温暖的，⟪k:4⟫"
"仿佛能包容他的一切的东西……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fdb2330df8c3fcdc8e4d4d80df758daa4caa53f535dbb4f07bc00acde9c110c
#. default-sha256: 4d541315d24c1bff9c4809cfc609244e32516a322e332ebbc3604bb00bd03f5d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E93951E_197D_4B67_AACD_D5F879C7EB47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had gone through his life shunned, feared, pushed away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To him, that was "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对他而言，⟪k:1⟫被世人疏远、⟪k:2⟫被世人恐惧、⟪k:3⟫被世人避之不及，那些才是常态。⟪k:4⟫从未有人"
"会喜欢他。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48e883bb5f46b71f27aa300517fdcd9bce2315e9daaf51f2cf6fd2ea9286a7ed
#. default-sha256: 39f4d2f7f8ed7f7896f92a5bf67cbea92058192041400153a2b9ba8783de8754
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA4739AD_440A_4B3E_BD69_6B2C9069D45E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never given anyone reason to have any fondness for him,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是的，⟪k:1⟫他从出生以来，⟪k:2⟫一次也没有体验过「被人喜欢」这种感觉。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_70E19D8A_D718_4F41_8B20_44ACB74FCC60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d1f3167948026f188a43604201a71d0afd59ffcf75934003679d00d4dc6ae6
